{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Peter and Online Dating", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Meant to Be Together", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 11, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le11ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Present Perfect Continuous vs Present Perfect Tenses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Present Perfect tense to talk about a past action or an action that began in the past that is connected to the present in some way. <br/><br/> You use Present Perfect Continuous tense to describe:<ul><li> a single activity that lasts a long time, and</li><li> an action that is repeated over a long period of time.</li></ul>These actions continue up to the present.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use the Present Perfect tense to talk about experience. When you use the Present Perfect tense, you think about the past and present together. There is some connection between what happened in the past and now. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": " For example:  <span class=\"italic\">I have learned English</span> = I learned English in the past and now I can speak English.<br/> <span class=\"italic\">He has bought a painting</span> = He bought the painting in the past and now he has a painting.  <br/><br/> You can use the Present Perfect Continuous tense when a long activity has just stopped.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To emphasize the action, use the continuous form. <span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>I've been chatting with a few girls on Tender in the past few days.</li> <li> I've been having problems keeping the conversation going sometimes.</li></ul></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To emphasize the result of the action, use the simple form. <span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>Have you found someone you're compatible with?</li> <li>I've had a couple of stimulating conversations so far.</li></ul></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Has/Have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Been\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verb+ing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\u2018ve\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"been\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" chatting with a few girls <span class=\\\"strong\\\">in</span> the past few days.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\u2018ve\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"been\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" shaving <span class=\\\"strong\\\">since</span> you signed up!\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<ul><li>You use FOR to talk about how long an action has been happening (a week, 2 days, five hours, six years, etc.).</li><li> You use SINCE to talk about when the action started (2010, Monday, she was a child).</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " I've been making an effort to look good for her since I read that she likes clean-shaven guys.", "type": "example"}, {"content": " I've been talking to awesome guys, but I've been having problems keeping the conversation going sometimes.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Talking about Wishes and Imaginary Situations  ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use  <span class=\"italic\">\u201cI wish ... \u201d</span> to talk about things you do not have or do, or you cannot have or do.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The verb  <span class=\"italic\">wish</span> introduces an idea. After  <span class=\"italic\">wish</span>, you use a verb in the past tense.<br/><br/>  I wish I knew ...<br/> I wish I had ...<br/> I wish you were ...<br/><br/>  Structure: <br/> Wish + Simple Past tense", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I wish I could tell you for sure.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I want to tell you, but I'm not sure.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">  I wish they were more motivated!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" They aren't motivated enough.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I wish I weren't so nervous about dating!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I am nervous about dating.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I wish I knew for sure that my contacts are impressed with my profile.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I would like my contacts to be impressed, but I don't know if they are.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "compatible", "type": "name"}, {"content": " two people able to exist well together", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Have you found someone you're compatible with?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le11ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when you talk about relationships.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "encouraging", "type": "name"}, {"content": "giving someone support and confidence; positive", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've received a lot of messages. I guess it's encouraging.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le11ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "exhausting", "type": "name"}, {"content": " making one feel very tired", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Looking for a date online is exhausting.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le11ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "stimulating", "type": "name"}, {"content": " arousing interest and enthusiasm", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I've had a couple of stimulating conversations so far.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le11ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "motivated", "type": "name"}, {"content": " having interest in doing something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I wish the guys I met were more motivated!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le11ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "impressed", "type": "name"}, {"content": "feeling admiration and awe", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I wish I knew for sure that my contacts are impressed with my profile.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le11ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "a match made in Heaven!", "type": "name"}, {"content": " two people who go very well together", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This date sounds like it's a match made in Heaven!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le11ob03aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "conten